# Planning artifacts live under `_planning/`

Agent-generated or session status, planning notes, scratch prompts, and similar working documents belong under **`_planning/`** at the repository root — not in the repo root and not mixed into shipped docs under `docs/` or `readme/`.

## Put here

- Project status / progress logs (e.g. `_planning/PROJECT-STATUS.md`)
- Implementation plans, investigation notes, and checklists that are not release docs
- Cursor / agent prompts and copies of task briefs used while working
- Temporary design dumps that should not be committed

## Do not put here

- User-facing or release documentation (`docs/`, `readme/`, MkDocs)
- Always-on agent rules (those stay in `.agents/rules/` with AGENTS.md kept in sync)
- Secrets, credentials, or live laptop dumps that may contain private paths or tokens

## Git

`_planning/` is **gitignored**. Do not `git add -f` its contents unless the user explicitly asks to commit a specific planning file. Prefer leaving planning artifacts local-only.
